@base_url = http://localhost:5275

### Get all Loaned Books

GET {{base_url}}/api/books

### Get Fine for a specific book loan 
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/2/fine

### Checkout Book

POST {{{{base_url}}}}/api/books
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "The Great Gatsby",
    "id": 4
}